@host = http://localhost:5041
@token = pegue_aqui_el_accessToken

### Estado de la API y SQL Server
GET {{host}}/health

### Crear el primer administrador (solo funciona si no existen cuentas)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/setup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "email": "admin@snic.local",
  "displayName": "Administrador SNIC",
  "password": "reemplace_con_una_clave_segura"
}

### Iniciar sesión
POST {{host}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "reemplace_con_una_clave_segura"
}

### Cuenta asociada al token
GET {{host}}/api/v1/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Consultar instituciones (cualquiera de los tres roles)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/institutions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Consultar cuentas (administrador)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/accounts
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Registrar una persona (DATA_ENTRY)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/persons
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nationalId": "00112345678",
  "firstName": "Ana",
  "middleName": "Maria Elena",
  "firstSurname": "Perez",
  "secondSurname": "Gomez",
  "birthDate": "1992-04-18"
}

### Registrar un producto crediticio (DATA_ENTRY, institución de su cuenta)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/credit-products
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "personId": 1,
  "productTypeCode": "LOAN",
  "productStatusCode": "OPEN",
  "externalProductIdentifier": "PREST-DEMO-001",
  "approvedAmount": 250000,
  "currentBalance": 180000,
  "currencyCode": "DOP",
  "openingDate": "2024-01-15",
  "closingDate": null,
  "latestReportDate": "2026-11-01",
  "latestDaysPastDue": 8
}

### Consulta consolidada por cédula (cualquiera de los tres roles)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/credit-reports/00112345678
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
